WEBVTT

00:20.550 --> 00:21.820
Onii-chan...

00:22.360 --> 00:24.210
Where did you go without your spear?

00:30.320 --> 00:32.480
There are men and women.

00:33.070 --> 00:37.030
As they evolved, variations emerged.

00:38.360 --> 00:42.650
Men gained strength,
but lacked magic and wings.

00:43.540 --> 00:47.830
Women became weak,
but gained magic and wings.

02:14.570 --> 02:18.570
I'll Call You!

02:26.070 --> 02:28.230
I can't sleep at all.

02:28.230 --> 02:30.980
It's so hard that my hip hurts. My back hurts.

02:31.970 --> 02:33.570
Aren't you in pain?

02:38.430 --> 02:41.110
Huh? Good morning.

02:41.110 --> 02:43.980
I'm amazed you could sleep
so soundly in this bed.

02:43.980 --> 02:46.420
Really? Isn't every house's
bed like this one?

02:47.630 --> 02:48.690
Well, then.

02:49.190 --> 02:50.020
Huh?

02:50.640 --> 02:55.020
Aren't you going to ask me what I'm
doing in your bed or how I got here?

02:55.940 --> 02:57.710
You came in through the front door, right?

02:58.070 --> 03:00.780
That's not what I meant.

03:01.110 --> 03:02.310
Are you awake?

03:02.310 --> 03:03.760
Jörm, are you awake?

03:03.760 --> 03:05.080
It's morning!

03:05.390 --> 03:06.870
Good morning.

03:08.340 --> 03:09.580
A fairy!

03:09.580 --> 03:10.830
It's a fairy!

03:15.070 --> 03:16.250
What's going on?!

03:18.400 --> 03:19.460
She's so cute.

03:19.460 --> 03:20.380
So cute.

03:20.380 --> 03:22.160
Now that I've gotten a better look,
she's just kind of cute.

03:22.160 --> 03:24.000
Who are these girls?

03:24.000 --> 03:25.470
They're my sisters.

03:25.470 --> 03:28.490
I don't know whether to
call them cute or rude.

03:28.490 --> 03:30.520
Jörm, hurry up and make breakfast.

03:30.520 --> 03:31.480
Breakfast!

03:31.920 --> 03:32.660
Okay.

04:00.660 --> 04:03.220
Why did you make so much?

04:04.010 --> 04:07.970
Wait, is this for me?
Gee, thanks.

04:08.360 --> 04:10.430
Good morning. Is everyone awake?

04:10.430 --> 04:11.480
Good morning!

04:12.830 --> 04:14.480
Something smells good.

04:14.980 --> 04:17.330
Oh, it's a fairy.

04:17.330 --> 04:19.070
Is she your guest, Jörm?

04:19.070 --> 04:20.150
Yeah, that's right.

04:20.400 --> 04:23.150
Hey, who are these filthy men?

04:24.450 --> 04:26.670
What a foul-mouthed fairy.

04:26.670 --> 04:28.460
They're all my dads.

04:29.020 --> 04:30.260
They're her dads.

04:33.160 --> 04:34.320
All of them?

04:41.400 --> 04:43.190
Look at her eat.

04:43.190 --> 04:46.520
Jörm, introduce me to your cute guest.

04:46.520 --> 04:46.970
Okay.

04:47.600 --> 04:52.460
Um, her name's Syr... Syrorin.

04:53.360 --> 04:54.460
Syrorin, huh?

04:54.460 --> 04:55.600
Cute, cute.

04:56.900 --> 04:58.700
Syrorin, Syrorin!

04:59.320 --> 05:02.030
My name's not Syrorin!

05:05.170 --> 05:06.800
Come on, let's go.

05:06.800 --> 05:08.600
Safety first again today.

05:08.600 --> 05:11.150
Let's make sure everyone
returns without a scratch!

05:11.500 --> 05:12.370
Got it?!

05:12.630 --> 05:14.120
Yeah!

05:14.460 --> 05:16.400
Be careful.

05:19.110 --> 05:21.820
Well, we'd better get to work, too.

05:22.270 --> 05:23.390
What work?

05:26.130 --> 05:29.740
They're miners, so they
always come home dirty.

05:32.250 --> 05:34.100
That's everything.

05:55.010 --> 05:56.120
Now, then.

05:56.530 --> 05:58.120
Are you going to make deliveries now?

05:58.120 --> 05:59.340
You're not going to rest?

05:59.790 --> 06:01.130
You're an awfully hard worker.

06:01.950 --> 06:03.460
That's not true.

06:09.220 --> 06:10.010
Could it be...

06:21.680 --> 06:23.090
Jörm.

06:23.090 --> 06:25.400
It's dangerous, so you girls wait here.

06:25.400 --> 06:26.570
I'll go check it out.

06:42.420 --> 06:44.200
It's a cave in.

06:45.210 --> 06:47.300
Hello!

06:59.660 --> 07:02.100
Are you going to dig with your axe?

07:02.660 --> 07:03.980
What else can I do?

07:07.860 --> 07:09.240
I'll go get everyone.

08:01.290 --> 08:02.970
Who are you?

08:02.970 --> 08:04.320
Who are these girls?

08:04.320 --> 08:06.540
I'll introduce you later. Hurry, hurry!

08:10.130 --> 08:12.300
Jörmungand must have dug this.

08:17.310 --> 08:19.510
What amazing power.

08:19.510 --> 08:21.230
She may not need anyone
to help her after all.

08:33.840 --> 08:37.310
I'm not finished yet. How pathetic...

08:38.670 --> 08:41.280
Hey, Dads!

08:41.870 --> 08:44.370
Answer me!

08:47.720 --> 08:51.340
Please, save my dads for me.

08:53.050 --> 08:54.340
I'll give it a try.

08:58.540 --> 08:59.260
Wait!

08:59.540 --> 09:00.550
What?

09:00.550 --> 09:02.590
Your magic is fire.

09:03.350 --> 09:05.200
Isn't this a coal mine?

09:06.800 --> 09:09.270
Won't your fire ignite the
gas and make it explode?

09:10.860 --> 09:12.300
What are we going to do, then?

09:12.300 --> 09:14.060
I'll try transforming.

09:14.060 --> 09:16.200
But you're a water user.

09:16.200 --> 09:17.980
What can you do with water?

09:20.060 --> 09:21.800
There's a gap here.

09:22.410 --> 09:24.660
I wonder how far it goes.

09:24.660 --> 09:26.440
Maybe you can fit through?

09:27.180 --> 09:27.710
Huh?

09:28.110 --> 09:31.080
Please make sure my dads are all right!

09:31.080 --> 09:31.880
What?

09:33.170 --> 09:35.820
Okay, fine. I'll go as far as I can.

09:36.210 --> 09:38.250
Thank you. Be careful.

09:38.250 --> 09:39.380
Okay...

09:51.570 --> 09:55.990
Hey, don't tell me it's going
to collapse even more...

09:57.200 --> 09:58.240
Where am I?

09:58.570 --> 10:00.050
There's no one here.

10:00.050 --> 10:01.310
Are they farther down?

10:10.770 --> 10:12.880
Th-That was close...

10:14.250 --> 10:15.440
Help is here!

10:15.440 --> 10:18.380
You nearly killed your help!

10:18.610 --> 10:19.960
All right!

10:21.410 --> 10:22.570
We made it!

10:24.500 --> 10:26.650
It looks like everyone's all right.

10:26.650 --> 10:29.230
Fairy, are you alone? Where's Jörm?

10:29.660 --> 10:31.220
Is she nearby?

10:31.220 --> 10:31.940
What?

10:32.260 --> 10:34.440
What's it like up ahead?

10:34.440 --> 10:36.940
How much of the tunnel has caved in?

10:37.370 --> 10:42.110
Um, Jörmungand did her best
to dig pretty far, but...

10:42.520 --> 10:43.980
She used up all her strength.

10:44.310 --> 10:45.450
I see.

10:45.890 --> 10:49.100
But she did her best for us.

10:49.100 --> 10:50.530
She's a good girl.

10:50.530 --> 10:52.960
We'd better do our best, too.

10:53.180 --> 10:54.680
Yeah!

10:55.790 --> 10:58.340
I wonder if she found my dads.

11:00.120 --> 11:01.870
It shook pretty violently.

11:01.870 --> 11:04.230
You don't think she got crushed, do you?

11:04.230 --> 11:06.670
Don't say things that
will make us anxious.

11:07.200 --> 11:08.230
Sorry...

11:10.690 --> 11:14.490
By the way, we were in a similar
place yesterday, weren't we?

11:14.490 --> 11:16.020
Oh, you're right.

11:16.020 --> 11:19.300
The only difference is we're not
having food delivered to us.

11:22.120 --> 11:23.400
Whose stomach was that?

11:23.830 --> 11:25.150
Not mine.

11:25.150 --> 11:26.370
It wasn't mine either.

11:26.800 --> 11:29.790
But we're the only ones here, right?

11:29.790 --> 11:32.230
Isn't is usually whoever mentioned it?

11:32.230 --> 11:34.380
No, no. It wasn't me.

11:36.790 --> 11:37.720
How cold!

11:37.720 --> 11:39.550
What? Is it barley tea?

11:39.550 --> 11:40.880
This sound...

11:48.270 --> 11:49.870
It's water!

11:49.870 --> 11:50.770
The water's coming!

11:51.170 --> 11:53.220
The ground water is flowing in.

11:53.960 --> 11:55.020
This isn't good.

11:55.990 --> 11:57.860
It's getting stronger.

11:58.360 --> 12:00.160
At this rate, my dads...

12:01.120 --> 12:02.400
I'll do something.

12:05.370 --> 12:07.200
Water, calm yourself.

12:07.730 --> 12:09.410
Go back to where you came from.

12:12.430 --> 12:13.580
Stop, stop!

12:13.580 --> 12:14.680
I give up!

12:17.770 --> 12:20.560
You can't do anything
without transforming.

12:21.760 --> 12:23.050
Fine.

12:58.420 --> 13:00.170
Water, calm yourself.

13:01.200 --> 13:02.920
Return from whence...

13:04.290 --> 13:05.470
...you came!

13:21.710 --> 13:23.610
That was amazing! Good job!

13:26.220 --> 13:27.310
Are you okay?

13:28.390 --> 13:30.470
The water seems to have stopped.

13:31.420 --> 13:33.190
The water suddenly disappeared.

13:33.600 --> 13:35.870
It must be Leviatan. I knew she could do it.

13:36.690 --> 13:40.080
I'll go tell them you're all okay.

13:40.520 --> 13:41.970
Yeah, please do.

13:47.000 --> 13:49.280
I'm glad her dads are all right.

13:54.140 --> 13:55.360
Just a little farther...

13:58.580 --> 14:00.510
Huh? Is that...

14:01.440 --> 14:03.160
I found a sphere.

14:03.160 --> 14:06.540
Now I can summon Yurlungur with
the agreement we made yesterday.

14:07.060 --> 14:08.440
All right!

14:10.440 --> 14:11.660
A Toripu!

14:11.660 --> 14:13.410
They're all the way down here.

14:14.170 --> 14:15.380
Give that back!

14:18.700 --> 14:21.870
No!

14:25.490 --> 14:26.710
That was close.

14:26.710 --> 14:29.450
It's precious, so you should
be more careful with it!

14:32.760 --> 14:35.060
You're after the sphere?

14:35.060 --> 14:36.980
I'll never let you have it.

14:38.560 --> 14:39.980
What should we do?

14:41.500 --> 14:44.780
Hey, why don't we summon
the master of the swamp?

14:45.050 --> 14:46.070
Oh, right.

14:46.070 --> 14:48.600
He said we should call him
whenever we're in trouble.

14:48.600 --> 14:49.830
I had forgotten all about that.

14:49.830 --> 14:51.160
Let's call him immediately.

14:51.760 --> 14:53.000
Ready, and...

14:53.000 --> 14:55.940
Yurlungur!

14:53.000 --> 14:55.940
Master of the swamp!

14:55.940 --> 14:58.050
Come on, now.

14:58.050 --> 15:00.420
Wouldn't you normally
call him by his name?

15:00.420 --> 15:02.460
What's the master of the swamp, anyway?

15:02.460 --> 15:05.000
Huh? I'm surprised you
remember his name.

15:05.000 --> 15:06.670
It just happened yesterday.

15:06.670 --> 15:10.680
It seems he won't come either way.

15:13.910 --> 15:15.680
Once I get through here...

15:16.760 --> 15:20.220
No! I'm delivering this to Leviatan!

15:30.080 --> 15:32.820
Leviatan, take this!

15:40.750 --> 15:42.080
What's going on?

15:42.080 --> 15:43.680
This thing grew out of the wall.

15:44.720 --> 15:46.300
How beautiful.

15:46.820 --> 15:49.920
This isn't the time to
be picking up pebbles.

15:54.910 --> 15:55.910
Huh? What?

16:06.610 --> 16:07.970
What is that?

16:07.970 --> 16:08.890
What's going on?

16:12.920 --> 16:14.920
He's going to eat us!

16:28.250 --> 16:30.420
Dads!

16:30.420 --> 16:33.300
Sorry for making you worry. Thanks.

16:34.090 --> 16:36.000
I'm glad you're all right.

16:36.810 --> 16:39.270
I'm glad you took the sphere.

16:39.690 --> 16:43.330
You figured out how to summon
Yurlungur immediately, didn't you?

16:43.800 --> 16:45.060
The sphere?

16:45.060 --> 16:47.120
Yeah, that shining rock.

16:47.120 --> 16:50.320
What? Oh, that...

16:50.750 --> 16:53.070
Let's celebrate!

16:53.070 --> 16:55.350
Yeah!

16:59.230 --> 17:00.370
Thanks for waiting.

17:00.370 --> 17:02.230
Excuse us.

17:02.620 --> 17:04.040
Good evening.

17:04.040 --> 17:06.250
We're from the Dragon's Key Tail.

17:09.070 --> 17:12.880
I thought we were done for when
the ground water flowed in.

17:13.180 --> 17:15.060
So did I.

17:15.060 --> 17:16.390
That was close.

17:17.050 --> 17:20.310
I'm impressed you were able
to summon the guardian.

17:20.800 --> 17:22.060
The guardian?

17:22.360 --> 17:25.560
That's right. You called Yurlungur, didn't you?

17:26.230 --> 17:28.500
Oh, the summoning...

17:28.500 --> 17:30.570
I didn't know that was so amazing.

17:30.840 --> 17:33.420
We occasionally find them in the mine,

17:33.420 --> 17:36.320
but we don't have an agreement
with the guardian.

17:36.820 --> 17:39.860
Nothing happens when we break them.

17:41.460 --> 17:42.830
I see.

17:42.830 --> 17:46.480
So, which one's your dad?

17:46.480 --> 17:49.310
What? Everyone here.

17:51.200 --> 17:52.210
Everyone?

17:54.540 --> 17:56.260
What does that mean?

17:56.620 --> 17:58.630
They took me in.

17:58.630 --> 18:00.970
My dads raised me.

18:01.610 --> 18:03.430
That's why they're all my dads.

18:06.130 --> 18:07.440
Don't tell me...

18:07.440 --> 18:09.610
We're our dads' kids, too.

18:09.920 --> 18:11.870
In other words, we're all family.

18:12.370 --> 18:14.610
Come on, introduce yourselves
to the nice ladies.

18:14.610 --> 18:15.830
I'm Metal.

18:15.830 --> 18:16.820
I'm Rudra.

18:16.820 --> 18:18.150
I'm Ragon.

18:18.150 --> 18:21.620
Thank you for looking after Jörm Onee-chan.

18:22.150 --> 18:25.120
So, that's what you meant by your dads.

18:25.370 --> 18:28.780
Travis-san and the others
really love Jörm-chan.

18:28.780 --> 18:30.980
They call her their treasure.

18:33.500 --> 18:36.130
That's why I want to return the favor.

18:36.130 --> 18:39.840
I want to be useful to
everyone, not just my dads.

18:40.290 --> 18:41.260
I see.

18:42.130 --> 18:45.140
In that case, why don't you
join the Aquafall Defense?

18:45.600 --> 18:46.790
What's that?

18:46.790 --> 18:49.520
I'd be happy to join if
you'll have me, Syrorin.

18:50.580 --> 18:51.520
Syrorin?

18:51.870 --> 18:53.520
Syrorin, Syrorin!

18:53.750 --> 18:56.360
Thanks for everything, Syrorin.

18:57.090 --> 19:00.560
Don't call me Syrorin!

20:12.620 --> 25:23.060
Next Episode

20:15.540 --> 20:20.460
I'm Going on Vacation!
